      "mergedPostDetails": "In previous versions of the UI, if you open a friend's bio, you could then click on the world they're in to read about the world (to see if it's something you might want to join in on or the like). Now there doesn't seem to be any link like that, so to find out about the world you have to go to the \"social\" tab and then re-find the friend in the \"friend locations\" section. This is an added barrier to joining friends, which impedes socialization.",
